<#f0821e>FLASH STEP</>
Flash Step		^X
  Shunpo: a teleport dash, forward or back with the
  direction. Uses one of 3 stocks, which refill over time.
  Cancels a normal on contact and works in the air.

<#f0821e>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
  A close, unblockable strike that knocks down.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Guard		_B
Dash / Back Dash (air too)		_F_F / _B_B
Super Jump		_D_U

<#f0821e>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Strong		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Strong		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Strong		^A / ^B / ^C

<#f0821e>SPECIALS</>
  The C version is stronger and uses a Flash Step stock.
Anken		_D_F^A / ^B / ^C
Kokubyouenbu		_B_D_F^A / ^B / ^C
Oruka Mono		_D_U^A / ^B / ^C
Owarija		_F_D_F^A / ^B / ^C

<#f0821e>SUPERS</>
Bakamonoga (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Any two of A/B/C work.
Bakamonoga Lv3 (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  A second shadow clone joins in, 2.5x damage, hard knockdown.
